  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of baboons displaying genitalia",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the baboons, specifically their exposed red genitalia, which is central to the meme's crude humor and shock value. The user is implicitly invited to see the image and connect it to the text, thereby internalizing the vulgar pun. The projection is not explicit (e.g., no 'you' or 'me'), but the user is required to engage with the visual material to understand the meme's intent, making the visual material the focal point of the user's projection.",
